OL,3,ANevada wildfire expected to burn for 48
OL,4,Ahours and may spread further, officials
OL,5,Asay
OL,6,
OL,7,FA large wildfire approaching Reno,
OL,8,FNevada, could remain active for the
OL,9,Fnext 48 hours due to dry and windy
OL,10,Fconditions, officials say
OL,12,FHawk Fire Service says the fire - first
OL,13,Freported on Saturday - could spread
OL,14,Ffurther north and there is no timeline
OL,15,Ffor when nearly 90,000 evacuated people
OL,16,Fcan return to the area
OL,18,FA state of emergency has been declared
OL,19,Fin Washoe County, north-west Nevada, as
OL,20,FGovernor Joe Lombardo calls it an
OL,21,F"active and rapidly evolving situation"
